      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I just don’t know what to do... My Meditite can’t\nseem to keep focused for very long at all.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I guess I’ve finally got no choice but to ask for\nhelp from the legendary yoga master!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I heard from one of my yogi friends that the yoga\nmaster trains at “one circle among the five,” where<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n“<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>the clock points to 12:00<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.”<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 146
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Once you reach that circle, she said the master\nwould be found at “<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>the spot closest to heaven<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.”<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 108
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please! Could you help me find the legendary\nyoga master? Do it for Meditite!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Apparently the legendary yoga master can be\nfound at “the spot closest to heaven” in the “one<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncircle among the five” that “points to 12:00.”<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 148
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "All right, Medicham! Let’s end our training for\ntoday.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C002000720069006700680074002C0020004D006500640069006300680061006D00210020004C006500742019007300200065006E00640020006F0075007200200074007200610069006E0069006E006700200066006F0072000A0074006F006400610079002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh? Do you need something?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068003F00200044006F00200079006F00750020006E00650065006400200073006F006D0065007400680069006E0067003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "...That’s right. I’m the one some people call the\nlegendary yoga master.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƝ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What brought you to me today, then?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƝ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800610074002000620072006F007500670068007400200079006F007500200074006F0020006D006500200074006F006400610079002C0020007400680065006E003F001000020114019D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Um, hello. I wanted to talk to you about my\nMeditite... It just can’t seem to stay focused!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve been making sure to give it plenty to eat, so it\ncan’t possibly be getting distracted by hunger!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, there’s your problem.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƝ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065006C006C002C0020007400680065007200652019007300200079006F00750072002000700072006F0062006C0065006D002E001000020114019D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Your Meditite should be eating just one Berry\neach day.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƝ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007500720020004D0065006400690074006900740065002000730068006F0075006C006400200062006500200065006100740069006E00670020006A0075007300740020006F006E0065002000420065007200720079000A00650061006300680020006400610079002E001000020114019D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eating more than necessary can put undue stress\non Meditite’s body, you know.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƝ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What...? But I just—<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800610074002E002E002E003F0020004200750074002000490020006A007500730074201400100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Don’t be alarmed. I’ll teach you all you need to\nknow, starting from the basics.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƝ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Really? Thank you so much! I can see why people\ncall you the legendary yoga master!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Medi!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00650064006900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And thanks to you for helping me find who I was\nlooking for!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E00640020007400680061006E006B007300200074006F00200079006F007500200066006F0072002000680065006C00700069006E00670020006D0065002000660069006E0064002000770068006F002000490020007700610073000A006C006F006F006B0069006E006700200066006F0072002100100002011401790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I don’t think I could get by on just one Berry each\nday, but I’ll make sure to take good care of myself<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nso I can take good care of Meditite!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 148
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Meditite and I often practice meditation together,\nbut I’m the only one who always nods off...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Focus comes from diligent training.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƝ",
